    "length": 6,
    "ja": "メール",
    "en": "Mail"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 530255,
    "length": 67,
    "ja": "こないだ見つけたギターおぼえてる？\nネックが少しはげた、中古のヤツ。",
    "en": "Remember that used guitar\nwith the worn neck?"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 530323,
    "length": 6,
    "ja": "メール",
    "en": "Mail"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 530330,
    "length": 57,
    "ja": "買ったんだよ！　あれさ！\nお年玉２年分、全部すっとんだよ！",
    "en": "Got it! The guitar!\nSpent two years' allowance!"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 530388,
    "length": 6,
    "ja": "メール",
    "en": "Mail"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 530395,
    "length": 59,
    "ja": "いやー、すごく、なやんだけど…\nオレの行動、ロックだよなー。",
    "en": "I really agonized...\nBut that's rockin', right?"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
