    "en": "Hellooo!!!"
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50326,
    "length": 34,
    "ja": "…ようこそ、えらばれし者たちよ…。",
    "en": "...Welcome, chosen ones..."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50361,
    "length": 61,
    "ja": "自らの意志で、　　　　　　　　\n世界をえらびとりし者たちよ…。",
    "en": "Those who chose this world\nby your own will..."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50423,
    "length": 53,
    "ja": "そは竜の世界。　　　　　　\nそは＜スピリット＞の世界。",
    "en": "A world of Dragons.\nA world of Spirits."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50477,
    "length": 61,
    "ja": "そは汝（なんじ）らがみちびく、\nあたらしき可能性の世界。　　　",
    "en": "A world of new possibilities,\nshaped by you."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50539,
    "length": 30,
    "ja": "自らの＜スピリット＞をしめせ。",
