    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50570,
    "length": 18,
    "ja": "戦え。そして勝て。",
    "en": "Fight. And win."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50589,
    "length": 57,
    "ja": "勝者の名の元に　　　　　　　\n＜スピリット＞は明示され…。",
    "en": "The victor will reveal\ntheir Spirit..."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50647,
    "length": 34,
    "ja": "やがて、世界はいやされるだろう…。",
    "en": "The world will be healed..."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50682,
    "length": 36,
    "ja": "行くがよい。汝らをまつ、主のもとへ。",
    "en": "Go now, to the one who awaits..."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50719,
    "length": 61,
    "ja": "闇（やみ）をぬけて。　　　　　\n自らの想いの音色をだきしめて。",
    "en": "Through the darkness...\nHold close your heart's own song."
  },
  {
    "file": "data/new_script_dat.pac",
    "offset": 50781,
    "length": 32,
    "ja": "ようこそ、えらばれし者たちよ…。",
    "en": "Welcome, chosen ones..."
